# This project is pinned by yarn.lock. Running `npm install` here generates a competing lockfile
# (and rewrites every resolved URL in yarn.lock from registry.yarnpkg.com to registry.npmjs.org),
# which is noise in review and gives Vercel two lockfiles to choose between. Keep it out.
/package-lock.json
